# Use one Conventional Commit line

Follow the one-line commit format in
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#commits-and-publication). Make summaries casual,
playful and preferably funny, with humor that describes the actual change.
Keep the outcome clear and the entire message on one line. User-facing `feat`, `fix`
and `perf` subjects start with a capital and describe the benefit without
internal names or comparisons. No body or attribution. Never bypass hooks.
